# BorrowHub Mobile — optional overrides
# By default the app finds the backend automatically:
#   - Web (Chrome):  same host as the page, port 8000
#   - Expo Go phone: the IP of the computer running Metro (from the QR code), port 8000
# Only set these if your backend lives somewhere else (or when using `npm run tunnel`).
# Copy to .env and restart Expo with: npx expo start --clear

# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.0.10:8000/api
# EXPO_PUBLIC_STORAGE_URL=http://192.168.0.10:8000/storage
